<details><summary>Why these actions?</summary>

Scores are a relative signal within this repo, not a probability. Will it break? is validated on bug-fix history; How bad if it breaks? is AI-assessed, not yet checked against maintainer ratings. Scores and repo cutoffs: Will it break? 33, How bad if it breaks? 78 (a score at or above its cutoff counts as high).

</details>
